#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst:59 a32fb57309a2452781bf452b77bd2f05
msgid "**SIDER_get_drug_side_effects** (Type: SiderTool)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst:61 14952016157b44aab1b25555c20f39d9
msgid ""
"Get the list of known side effects for a drug from SIDER, including "
"frequency data when available..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst 5c21b445dba5487a9b5367e94e5d3054
msgid "SIDER_get_drug_side_effects tool specification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst:67 12a6ae1b4c394b088af1e531465c49a2
msgid "**Name**: ``SIDER_get_drug_side_effects``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst:69 05e7d90c098f406bbbea80a4699216bf
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get the list of known side effects for a drug from "
"SIDER, including frequency data when available. Side effects are "
"extracted from drug labels and include MedDRA codes, frequency "
"percentages from clinical trials (e.g., '21% - 57.5%'), and placebo "
"comparison rates. Provide either a drug name (will auto-search) or a "
"SIDER drug ID from SIDER\\_search\\_drug. Returns adverse reactions "
"recorded in official drug labels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst:76 44f30f75215c442e92c09a559109e541
msgid ""
"``drug_name`` (string, null) (optional) Drug name (e.g., 'ibuprofen', "
"'metformin'). Will search SIDER and use first match. Mutually exclusive "
"with sider\\_drug\\_id."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst:79 22adccd472604feeb1818eccb3b9d382
msgid ""
"``sider_drug_id`` (string, null) (optional) SIDER drug ID (PubChem CID) "
"from SIDER\\_search\\_drug results (e.g., '3672' for ibuprofen, '4091' "
"for metformin)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst:82 11a802ba7cc24777b6ca714754d03331
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of side effects to return "
"(default: 50)"
msgstr ""

