msgid "SIDER_search_drug tool specification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst:147 9e7f36e103b748aaadffb5cbc511de20
msgid "**Name**: ``SIDER_search_drug``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst:149 eca964f63e7a451f9dd7111e430b8a6b
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the SIDER drug side effects database for a drug "
"by name. Returns matching drugs with SIDER IDs and any related side "
"effects. SIDER contains adverse drug reaction data extracted from drug "
"labels for marketed medicines. Use this to find the SIDER drug ID needed "
"for other SIDER operations (get\\_side\\_effects, get\\_indications)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst:156 d9b859b29e4f467db674f6a6afedf7d7
msgid ""
"``drug_name`` (string) (required) Drug name to search for (e.g., "
"'aspirin', 'ibuprofen', 'metformin', 'warfarin')"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst:174 b3c06892c7064607bb5a5e579462e725
msgid "**SIDER_search_side_effect** (Type: SiderTool)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst:176 5f2f4c42dda64557bfddb655a57d7b67
msgid ""
"Search for a side effect by name in SIDER. Returns matching side effects "
"with their MedDRA codes ..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst 547d532157264cb69a679ca9cb4e4f21
msgid "SIDER_search_side_effect tool specification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst:182 cbf508d469cc45bb9ede2fd087b91dbe
msgid "**Name**: ``SIDER_search_side_effect``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst:184 acf45d9364c44ffa8d63e73650516d0a
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for a side effect by name in SIDER. Returns "
"matching side effects with their MedDRA codes (UMLS CUIs). Use this to "
"find the correct MedDRA code for a side effect before querying "
"SIDER\\_get\\_drugs\\_for\\_side\\_effect. SIDER uses MedDRA (Medical "
"Dictionary for Regulatory Activities) terminology for standardized "
"adverse event reporting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/sider_tools.rst:191 58585a62d24547e18bf5a4d09799265f
msgid ""
"``side_effect_name`` (string) (required) Side effect name to search "
"(e.g., 'headache', 'nausea', 'diarrhea', 'liver')"
msgstr ""

